---
source: crates/tmt-cli-style/tests/rendering.rs
expression: "help_text(&root, PIPE)"
---
Collaborate with agents through durable tmux exchanges

Usage: tmt [OPTIONS] [COMMAND]

Commands:
  ls  List agents

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help
      --json  Output one JSON document

Extensions:
  squad (also: sq)  Lead a squad of agents
  office            Run the local Office

Examples:
  # See every agent
  tmt ls
